   "body": "hey, thanks for explanation. :) with ur rotation \n\"Sticky Bomb > Spider BOMB + Deathball > Bomb Toss > Firepot Drone > Scrap Shot >\"\ndo you double bomb toss or just the procc? especially when u \"spider bomb\" the \"firepot Drone\" chares GCD with \"spider bomb\" (Cause both dont have) so isnt it better todo the first \"Scrap shot\" before the \"Firepot Drone\" else u got downtime or is it what u meantioned with the \"3 bombs\" when u wait a second? i know u can throw 2 but 3?\n\nSry if its a bit long or hard to understand but especially at the opener the rotation feels more clunky cause u could scrap shot after the spider-toss combo insteat of wait for drone. \n\nty a lot for ur help :)",
